# RD Catalog — GUI performance

Domain overlay / pipeline / tabs stay in [AI_rd_catalog.mdc](AI_rd_catalog.mdc).
This file is only **where time goes** and **what a one-kit GUI action may rebuild**.
RFQ Step4 timings live in [AI_performance.mdc](AI_performance.mdc) — do not mix.

## Where timings appear

There is **no** `print()` / stdout channel like Step4 `timing_log`. Комплекты and
the rest of the catalog use nested `perf_span` from [`rd_catalog/perf_log.py`](rd_catalog/perf_log.py):

- File: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Documentation_PDF_out_NK\rd_catalog\perf.log`
- Duplicate: Qt tab **Журнал** (`set_perf_sink` → `_append_log`)
- Off: `RD_CATALOG_PERF=0` / `false` / `off`

Look for `BEGIN` / `END … elapsed_ms=`. Nested spans indent. Lines are **not**
PyCharm console output unless the process is launched so that journal text is
also echoed.

Wrap **coarse** GUI/domain operations only. Do **not** span per-cell paint,
`_apply_kits_filter`, or every helper (I/O on the GUI thread). A user-visible
action (mark working, legalize, keep_view scan) **must** have an outer span so
the total freeze is one number.

## Before: «Пометить папку как рабочую» (~10 s)

`_apply_tree_working_flag` used to persist one `kit_working_flag`, then
`rebuild_pipeline(..., kit_keys={that kit})` (cheap), then a **full GUI
refresh** on the GUI thread. Outer span: `gui.apply_tree_working_flag`.

Measured 2026-09-16 (~253 kits, ~2903 overlay-current files), one mark:

| Span | ms | Notes |
|---|---:|---|
| `pipeline.rebuild_pipeline kits=1` | 246 | scoped SQLite — OK |
| `gui.load_folder_tree_hints` | 89 | full catalog hints |
| `gui.reload_mto_worklist_rows` | 116 | full `list_mto_worklist` |
| `gui.refresh_kits_table` | 1362 | `official_detected_current_ids` 444 + `build_kit_matrix` 757 + paint 139 |
| `gui.refresh_revision_matrix` | **4859** | SQL ~9; rest is heatmap Qt + identities + export index |
| `gui.rebuild_document_tree` | **3402** | all titles/marks; `clear()` + new `QTreeWidgetItem`s |
| **sum of inner spans** | **~10 s** | plus `gui.auto_mto_compare_finished` after |

Same tree rebuild (~2.9 s) also ran when toggling «В узле ревизии» checkboxes.

## After: scoped refresh

One-kit derived writes (working flag, annulled flag, issuance journal decision) go through
`_refresh_after_scoped_pipeline` (`gui.refresh_after_scoped_pipeline`). That
path must **not** `QTreeWidget.clear()` the documents tree, must **not**
force-paint a still-deferred heatmap, must **not** `build_kit_matrix` over
every kit, must **not** walk `record_has_canonical_layout` over `_all_records`
on the GUI thread, and must **not** `hydrate_auto_mto_compare_cache` for the
whole catalog. «Пометить папку как аннулированную» uses the same path
(`gui.apply_tree_annulled_flag` → `gui.refresh_after_scoped_pipeline`).

| API / span | Role |
|---|---|
| `gui.refresh_after_scoped_pipeline` | Shared after-pipeline: hints, worklist rows, scoped kits, heatmap, live worklist, tree relabel |
| `gui.relabel_document_tree` | Repaint live revision nodes; no `clear()`. Label checkboxes use this |
| `_refresh_revision_matrix(kit_keys=, force=)` | Deferred heatmap stays deferred unless `force=True` (first visit) |
| `RevisionMatrixTab.patch_cells_for_kits` | In-place heatmap cell replace; `False` if never painted |
| `set_export_records(..., in_contour=)` | Skip a second layout walk when records are already contour |
| `_document_tree_kit_identities` | Cached; contour records skip `record_has_canonical_layout` |
| `_record_in_contour` | Contour id-set when `_contour_records` is set; else layout walk |
| `patch_official_detected_current_ids` | Patch official overlay ids for `kit_keys` only |
| `gui.jump_to_kit_documents` | Комплекты → «Все документы». Filter first, then tab switch. Must not `QTreeWidget.clear()` / `_rebuild_document_tree` when `_DEFERRED_TREE` is already discarded. Rebuild only if the documents tab is still deferred or the tree widget is empty. A live tree only hides+selects (`_sync_document_tree_filter_hidden`). |
| `_doc_bundles` | In-memory grouping cache keyed by `id(_all_records)` + overlay ids + skip_dirs + pending/problems; miss after `list_files`. |

`_ensure_deferred_widget(_DEFERRED_HEATMAP)` calls
`_refresh_revision_matrix(force=True)`. Ban / skip-dir / palette: live widgets
refresh, deferred stay deferred. Kits table is always live.
`gui.refresh` with `pipeline_subtrees` that resolve to `kit_keys` must
`_refresh_kits_table(kit_keys=)`, not `kits=all`.
SQ→RD keep_view must not force `gui.rebuild_document_tree`; same deferral as robot keep_view.
`_enqueue_mto_compare` / `_sync_official_rd_mto_compares` must not run
[`official_rd_mto_overlay`](rd_catalog/pipeline.py) /
[`build_mto_compare_plan`](rd_catalog/mto_compare_queue.py) on the GUI
thread; the child job [`mto_compare_job.py`](rd_catalog/mto_compare_job.py)
already plans (`list_present_robot_mto_files` included). Official-path
moves are detected from the in-memory worklist overlay
(`rd_mto_overlay_by_kit`). Scoped pipeline refresh still must not force
a heatmap hydrate just to enqueue.

Still catalog-wide on the scoped path (cheap vs tree/heatmap rebuild):
`gui.load_folder_tree_hints`, `gui.reload_mto_worklist_rows`. A live heatmap
still rebuilds the export index (`set_export_records`); «РД · рев.» paint is
limited to `kit_keys`. Ban-list identity cache uses `BanFilterStore.revision`.

## How to read a freeze

1. Reproduce the click.
2. Open **Журнал** or tail `perf.log`.
3. Find the outer `BEGIN`/`END` for the action, then the longest child.
4. After keep_view scan the chain is still
   `gui.scan_finished` → `gui.refresh` → `pipeline.rebuild_pipeline` /
   `gui.refresh_kits_table`. After mark-working it is
   `gui.apply_tree_working_flag` → `gui.refresh_after_scoped_pipeline`.
5. Jump Комплекты → «Все документы» is `gui.jump_to_kit_documents`. Nested
   `gui.rebuild_document_tree` at most once, and only if the documents tab
   was still deferred (or the tree widget empty). A live tree must only
   hide+select (`_sync_document_tree_filter_hidden`). Two consecutive
   unindented `BEGIN gui.rebuild_document_tree` is the old bug.
6. Комплекты right-click is `gui.show_kits_context_menu`. Must not `Path.is_file()`
   / UNC `stat` to enable «Авто МТО»; must not walk `_all_records` for mixed
   folders, package mean date, or path lookup (`_records_by_kit` /
   `_records_by_path_key`). Do not `selectRow` when the row is already current
   (that retriggers `gui.update_kits_card` / `get_kit_card`). Existence of the
   Auto MTO file is checked on open (`_open_auto_mto_cell`). After the menu,
   «Открыть содержащую папку · РД» must use the captured `row=` (not
   `_selected_kit_row()`): a nested `gui.kits_table_paint rows=251` during
   `exec` (`gui.auto_mto_compare_finished`) does `setRowCount` and drops
   selection, so the click would silently do nothing. The folder itself is
   opened with ``os.startfile`` ([`open_directory`](rd_catalog/path_actions.py)).
   Do not pass ``explorer /root,<path>``: a space in ``Для передачи`` quotes
   the whole switch and Explorer opens Documents.
